  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-cwtr5u",
      "text": "Okay, Doc, don't repeat this to the King's corona-cronies - new guy hit a personal best domain, came back like he'd just gone for milk. 1-0 on my ceelo record, one win deep, and rent still don't care. I can explain the first half of how he did it. The second half is where the screaming starts.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0009.md",
        "extractedDay": 9,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.453Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-4p059q",
      "text": "Ante two, X-treme, that's a personal best for dying fast - put me down for another roll before King James brings him back annoyed, I'm on four wins and rent doesn't care about your paperwork delays.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 4,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.454Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-24r4am",
      "text": "Clausen! Four wins deep, don't look at me like I'm a paperwork violation waiting to happen - some of us are just built different, or built fast, same thing really. Rent's due Friday but my luck isn't, so if Hell's briefcase is looking for volunteers, put me on the do-not-call list.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 4,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0013.md",
        "extractedDay": 13,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.454Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-ieobf9",
      "text": "General, four wins straight, I could roll dice against your own doctors and still make rent this month. Just the once though. Speaking of, your new guy owes half the building money and the other half apologies, figured you'd want the receipts before he dies again and forgets.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 4,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0022.md",
        "extractedDay": 22,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.458Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-gsf36g",
      "text": "Doc, four wins deep and my hat's still heavier than my wallet, so I'll take your gold if you're offering. Newcomer owes half the building already, don't let him near your library tab. Roll the dice before rent finds me first.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 4,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0022.md",
        "extractedDay": 22,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.458Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-9dh52f",
      "text": "Four wins deep and Willy's grinning like his eye's got a mortgage on my luck, but I already know the fifth roll's rent money talking. Newcomer's due back any second too, and buildings remember him worse than they remember me.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 4,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0027.md",
        "extractedDay": 27,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.460Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-v5bxmk",
      "text": "Twelve wins and you still can't close a tab, huh, that's rough - kid's not a body you count, he's a security deposit you never get back. I can explain the first half of that roll. The second half is where the screaming starts, and it wasn't yours.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "generous",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0042.md",
        "extractedDay": 42,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.465Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-4q9p2q",
      "text": "Bones, six and two, two in a row, and the kid still owes me a hundred gold he doesn't have. You're 12 and 18, so maybe don't talk streaks with me today.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0049.md",
        "extractedDay": 49,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.466Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-abaj0k",
      "text": "Six and nine, rough water, but hey, at least your rent's not due like mine is. Newcomer still owes me a hundred, and I'm four wins deep, so the math's working out for somebody in this room.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 4,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0054.md",
        "extractedDay": 54,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.468Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-lb7dc0",
      "text": "Willy, one eye and you still see me coming, that's the scary part. I'm down one game and 175 gold poorer thanks to the new guy, so tonight I collect from someone. Might as well be the giant eyeball with 28 losses.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0059.md",
        "extractedDay": 59,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.469Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-vgznq1",
      "text": "Boo G, tell me the new guy hasn't run a tab here too, because he's already 175 into me and rent doesn't care about my feelings.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0059.md",
        "extractedDay": 59,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.469Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-c6ye5u",
      "text": "Two losses ain't a streak, General, it's a warning shot. You're smug for a guy at 29 and 32, that's basically a rent history.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -3,
      "contextTags": [
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 3
        }
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0060.md",
        "extractedDay": 60,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.469Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-l32dsz",
      "text": "General, thirty-six and thirty-three, you're basically breaking even, which around here counts as a miracle. I got one loss on the board right now but the kid owes me 175 gold and I plan to collect before rent hits. Roll fast, I got places to be and buildings that still remember my face.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-25-39-241Z/days/day-0067.md",
        "extractedDay": 67,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.471Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-rf8bb5",
      "text": "Smug's easy when your kid's got a 175 gold tab running under my name and you still act like the house always wins. Roll the dice, General, rent doesn't care about your record and neither do I. I can explain the first half of this game, the second half is where your streak starts screaming.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-25-39-241Z/days/day-0067.md",
        "extractedDay": 67,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.471Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-6jha76",
      "text": "Doc, 38 and 39, you're basically my rent, always one loss from catastrophe. I'm riding a cold streak myself, but the new guy's cosmic bad luck makes yours look like a hobby. Roll the dice before he shows up and borrows against your losses too.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-38-23-809Z/days/day-0077.md",
        "extractedDay": 77,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.473Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-7kugdb",
      "text": "Doc, you read to a guy chained to the sun, don't get smug with me about a fifty-fifty record. I got a newcomer who owes me 175 gold and a landlord who thinks rent is a personal hobby, so tonight I need the gold more than you need the ego boost.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-38-23-809Z/days/day-0077.md",
        "extractedDay": 77,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.473Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-vwqh1o",
      "text": "Bow's crooked, tilted mood, six and nine, and you're still first in line ahead of me, so no, I can't leave. Landlord's basically cosplaying as a supervillain this month, so if you're here to fight someone, fight him first. New guy still owes me 175, by the way, if you're taking numbers.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-38-23-809Z/days/day-0078.md",
        "extractedDay": 78,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.474Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-rbik95",
      "text": "Two losses don't scare me, Maxwell, I've read worse odds on rent notices. You lick boots for a living, I'll take my chances with the dice.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 85,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-38-23-809Z/days/day-0079.md",
        "extractedDay": 79,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.474Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-keith-man-pvbgdm",
      "text": "Three losses, cold moon wind, and now a librarian with a smug face wants my gold too. Fine, Doc, roll them bones, but know the new guy's 175 is coming out of whoever's pile I win tonight.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "keith-man",
        "name": "Keith Man",
        "category": "travelers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
